# Build context = repository root (/root/projects/VideoClaw/).
# Keep the context lean: only video-claw/video-claw/{backend,frontend} source
# and docker-entrypoint.sh need to reach the builder.

# ---- Unrelated top-level repos / docs / pics in this monorepo ---------------
# These must NOT be sent to the builder (keeps the context small & fast).
.git
.claude
FilmAgent
FilmAgent-pics
video-claw-pics
video-claw/references
README.md
README_EN.md
LICENSE

# ---- Docker runtime data (persisted via volumes, never baked in) ------------
data/

# ---- Python (backend) ------------------------------------------------------
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/venv
**/.venv
video-claw/video-claw/backend/code/
video-claw/video-claw/backend/code.bak/
video-claw/video-claw/backend/temp/
video-claw/video-claw/backend/logs/
video-claw/video-claw/backend/docs/
# Local secrets/config — the persisted copy under ./data is used instead.
video-claw/video-claw/backend/config.yaml
video-claw/video-claw/backend/config.yaml.bak

# ---- Node (frontend) -------------------------------------------------------
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
video-claw/video-claw/frontend/.env*
!video-claw/video-claw/frontend/.env.example
video-claw/video-claw/frontend/test/
video-claw/video-claw/frontend/tests/

# ---- Editor noise ----------------------------------------------------------
**/.DS_Store
**/*.md
